    {
      "id": "2fe91028-058c-4fac-8620-e69d590ef472",
      "name": "Sticky Note 2fe91028",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -560,
        -96
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Stale Deal Reminder\n\nEvery weekday morning it finds open HubSpot deals with no logged activity for 7+ days. Each rep gets a Slack digest of their idle deals with an AI-suggested next step, a follow-up task is created in HubSpot the first time a deal goes stale, and the sales manager gets one alert listing everything idle for 14+ days.\n\n**Setup**\n1. Adjust **Pipeline Settings** (thresholds, portal ID). Also change the 7-day value inside `staleCutoffMs` if you change `staleDays`\n2. Connect HubSpot, Anthropic and Slack (plus Google Sheets for the error log)\n3. Create `#sales-team`, `#sales-managers` and `#automation-alerts`",
        "color": 7,
        "width": 480,
        "height": 460
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "69e7976d-8d5c-44df-8de4-08aa07e1e786",
      "name": "Sticky Note 69e7976d",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        192,
        304
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 1. Find idle deals\nOpen deals whose last activity (or creation date, if never touched) is older than the threshold. Owners are matched by ID.",
        "color": 4,
        "width": 832,
        "height": 224
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "21133d1f-dcac-4fc2-a5e9-9a99c1450555",
      "name": "Sticky Note 21133d1f",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1088,
        -96
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 2. Rep digests\nOne AI next step per deal, grouped into one Slack message per owner, oldest first.",
        "color": 5,
